@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-74 - Mark Conversation Read

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-74
FE -> API: PATCH /chat/conversations/:id/read
API -> Service: Execute Mark Conversation Read
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: unreadForManager = 0

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Conversation có unreadForManager > 0
Post: unreadForManager = 0
Main flow:
1. Admin mở conversation
2. System tự động gọi PATCH /chat/conversations/:id/read { target: manager\n}
3. unreadForManager reset về 0
end note
@enduml
